  "details": "The lens grabbing feature is super handy for repositioning world locked camera lenses but I wonder if it would be possible to allow other people to reposition your camera lens? This would be handy for video or streaming production in particular as well as photo taking.\nIt can be that you can toggle it on to allow friends only to grab your lens, or everyone, or an option to give an individual control.\nOne problem with this would be the 3rd party not being able to see what your camera is seeing in order to reposition it properly. But a screen could appear whilst that person is grabbing the lens to show what it sees.",
